# NOTE: android/release.keystore is intentionally tracked in git.
# Android refuses to update an installed app whose signing certificate
# changed (INSTALL_FAILED_UPDATE_INCOMPATIBLE), so the release keystore
# must travel with the repository. Do not re-add it here or regenerate it.

